{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 46","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_46\">Problem 46</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 46\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73138f9062ee2aca27afff51ecd3e36b1ccba9c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {1 + x}{1 - x} = \\frac {N + 1}{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" /> to be true where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can have: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5f8754fbd6ace7ca4cf2e0b7109ae2041a5ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{any positive value less than }1 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{any value less than }1 \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{the value zero only}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{any non-negative value}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{any value}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"248\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> by cross-multiplying:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/0/570a0fd667537edefdae3b1c0597be4d73c5a1a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N(1 + x) = (N + 1)(1 - x)\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c8b954aecf8fcdf0e3b66cb92abba5511f08245.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N + Nx = N - Nx + 1 - x\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb8c9633b2df90ef73c92be1e6aaa17ba2f2ea9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2Nx + x = 1\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986dc118a0d85b92d0bb7ab0fbffa67102c1ef06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(2N + 1) = 1 \\implies x = \\frac{1}{2N + 1}\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d96518b14791fb24d4ad960615ba45c1e622592.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/305eb765f1f939656782f661365ddc46116be78b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2N + 1 &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, which implies:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a889138150060cd65d163c610a3464a8784555.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 &lt; \\frac{1}{2N + 1} &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be any positive value less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/6/f86c831cd0853eaa72f84e71632f05991401a344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">Problem 45</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">Problem 47</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> 